  "project_description": "This module provides the ability to translate the block labels and inline blocks that are added in the Layout Builder. Currently the module only handles Layout overrides.\n\n Each translation will share the same(symmetric) layout. This module should be used when you want all the translations to have the same layout, sections and components, but the strings need to be translated.\n\n This module is as top gap until [#2946333] lands in core hopefully in 8.8.0\n\n If you want each translation to have independent layouts see the Layout Builder Asymmetric Translation module but the 2 modules will not work together on 1 site .",
